WEBVTT

00:08:57.616 --> 00:09:01.954
And it must be extraordinary
for you to see years of vision for this

00:09:01.954 --> 00:09:03.205
come into reality.

00:09:03.247 --> 00:09:05.124
So thank you for it.

00:09:05.165 --> 00:09:06.667
We thank you so much for this.

00:09:06.667 --> 00:09:07.876
Thank you.

00:09:07.876 --> 00:09:09.587
ANZ: Thank you so much. Thank you.

00:09:09.587 --> 00:09:14.425
(Applause)